        "action_date": "2026-01-30",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p>This resolution supports the designation of  the International Year of the Woman Farmer and recognizes the critical role of women in agriculture.</p><p>The resolution also encourages citizens to celebrate the impact these women have on the&nbsp;food systems and agricultural workforce of the United States by encouraging and empowering women to pursue careers in agriculture and cultivate leadership opportunities.</p>",
